Scorecard analysis	Run analysis	2026-08-05T06:19:54.8902696Z                      "name": "Token-Permissions",
Scorecard analysis	Run analysis	2026-08-05T06:19:54.8903806Z                      "helpUri": "https://github.com/ossf/scorecard/blob/c395761df6afe1a69e476bc60a013a94bcbc153f/docs/checks.md#token-permissions",
Scorecard analysis	Run analysis	2026-08-05T06:19:54.8905004Z                      "shortDescription": {
