Scorecard analysis	Run analysis	2026-08-05T06:19:54.9410021Z                      "name": "CII-Best-Practices",
Scorecard analysis	Run analysis	2026-08-05T06:19:54.9410653Z                      "helpUri": "https://github.com/ossf/scorecard/blob/c395761df6afe1a69e476bc60a013a94bcbc153f/docs/checks.md#cii-best-practices",
Scorecard analysis	Run analysis	2026-08-05T06:19:54.9411268Z                      "shortDescription": {
